          "id": 750029496,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It is strange. Double clicking on any interface starts capture on Linux and Windows.\nIsn't the case that in your setup selected extcap interface requires some mandatory parameter and as a consequence of it, configuration dialog is opened? But it should work on Capture Options too, I \"copied\" the code.\n\nNevertheless I do not see any exception for macOS in code...",
