        {
          "id": 750695269,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Just to review how current code (main) behaves:\n- single click on a device in Welcome screen just selects the row\n- double click on a device in Welcome screen starts a capture. When the device is extcap which requires missing mandatory parameters, it opens dialog for entering it.\n- single click on a device in Capture Options dialog just selects the row\n- double click on a device in Capture Options dialog does nothing special, behaves like single click\n\nThe request is to make it behave in Capture Options like on Welcome screen. Right?\nBTW I agree with you...",
